rverResult<TData, TError>[\"fetchPreviousPage\"];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fetches the previous page for the current infinite query."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"refetch","children":[{"type":"text","value":"refetch"}]},{"type":"code","value":"refetch: InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"refetch\"];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Refetches the current infinite query."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"destroy","text":"destroy","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"fetchnextpage","text":"fetchNextPage","level":3},{"id":"fetchpreviouspage","text":"fetchPreviousPage","level":3},{"id":"refetch","text":"refetch","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype InfiniteQueryResultAccessor<TData, TError> = ValueAccessor<InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/createInfiniteQueryController.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/createInfiniteQueryController.ts#L45)\n\nAccessor returned by `createInfiniteQueryController`.\n\nCall the accessor or read its `current` property to get the latest infinite\nquery result. The attached methods delegate to the active infinite query\nobserver.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### destroy\n\n```ts\ndestroy: () => void;\n```\n\nRemoves the controller from its Lit host and unsubscribes observers.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n### fetchNextPage\n\n```ts\nfetchNextPage: InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"fetchNextPage\"];\n```\n\nFetches the next page for the current infinite query.\n\n### fetchPreviousPage\n\n```ts\nfetchPreviousPage: InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"fetchPreviousPage\"];\n```\n\nFetches the previous page for the current infinite query.\n\n### refetch\n\n```ts\nrefetch: InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"refetch\"];\n```\n\nRefetches the current infinite query.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: InfiniteQueryResultAccessor\ntitle: InfiniteQueryResultAccessor\n---\n\n```ts\ntype InfiniteQueryResultAccessor<TData, TError> = ValueAccessor<InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/createInfiniteQueryController.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/createInfiniteQueryController.ts#L45)\n\nAccessor returned by `createInfiniteQueryController`.\n\nCall the accessor or read its `current` property to get the latest infinite\nquery result. The attached methods delegate to the active infinite query\nobserver.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### destroy\n\n```ts\ndestroy: () => void;\n```\n\nRemoves the controller from its Lit host and unsubscribes observers.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n### fetchNextPage\n\n```ts\nfetchNextPage: InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"fetchNextPage\"];\n```\n\nFetches the next page for the current infinite query.\n\n### fetchPreviousPage\n\n```ts\nfetchPreviousPage: InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"fetchPreviousPage\"];\n```\n\nFetches the previous page for the current infinite query.\n\n### refetch\n\n```ts\nrefetch: InfiniteQueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"refetch\"];\n```\n\nRefetches the current infinite query.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError`\n"}
